            <div xml:id="d326">

                <pb facs="0432" n="266" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg266"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 793.94/588</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-11-05T12:00:00+08:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 5, 1917, noon</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Japanese Legation yesterday handed to the Foreign Office copy of the note to
                    Ishii, stated to have been [signed by?] [yourself?] on November 2. The Foreign
                    Office is making inquiry here. This Legation is in a highly embarrassing
                    position having received no information.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
